From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 22:18:42 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] logging: expose typed parameter interaction decisions without
 option values

Convert fourteen startup parameter-interaction messages with exact original wording and Info severity. Add typed trigger/target option names and resulting boolean, without exposing supplied option values. No option defaults, precedence or conditions change. Extend actual-node JSON regression to check whitelist relay interaction.

Scripted diff commands (ast-grep-py==0.51.0):
