/private/tmp/lane-n4-build/logging-compose/ast-venv/bin/python contrib/logging/conversion/test_convert.py
python3 test/lint/lint-log-events.py src/init.cpp
Support: three appended registry fields, recorded in catalog. Fixtures15/15, lint28sites, Ruff0.15.8, empty idempotence diff pass. Native init compile/runtime pending scheduler.
